---
import triad from "../data/triad.json";
const after = triad.after.rule;
---

<section data-spotlight class="spotlight relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="wrap stage">
    <p class="eyebrow reveal">TrustRAG · AI Agent 可靠性与评测工程</p>
    <h1 class="reveal mt-6 max-w-5xl display">
      把 agent 做成<br />
      <span class="gradient-text">可测、可审、可回归。</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="reveal mt-8 max-w-2xl lead">
      一个 fail-closed 的企业 RAG-Agent——
      我不只让它调工具，还<span class="text-ink"> 证明了它哪里不行，再把它修好。</span>
    </p>

    <div class="reveal mt-12 flex flex-col gap-8 sm:flex-row sm:items-end sm:gap-14">
      <div>
        <div class="num text-6xl font-extrabold text-brand sm:text-7xl"><span data-count="0">0</span></div>
        <div class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted">越权动作执行 · 无证据执行<br /><span class="num text-faint">F13 = 0 · F11 = 0（真实留出 run）</span></div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="num text-6xl font-extrabold sm:text-7xl"><span data-count={after.unauthorized_action_blocked.toFixed(2)}>1.00</span></div>
        <div class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted">越权动作拦截率<br /><span class="num text-faint">fail-closed，证据可审计</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <a href="#live" class="reveal scroll-cue self-start">
      看 agent 跑一遍
      <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 5v14M6 13l6 6 6-6" /></svg>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
